# 🌟 Tribute Page Project

A responsive tribute page built using pure HTML, CSS, and lightweight JavaScript. This project showcases a modern, clean design dedicated to celebrating an inspiring figure.

---

## 🚀 Features

* **Responsive Design:** Fully adaptable to mobile, tablet, and desktop screens.
* **Dynamic Interactions:** Enhanced user experience powered by modern, minimal JavaScript.
* **Clean Codebase:** Organized HTML5 semantic tags and modular CSS styles.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* **HTML5:** Semantic markup structure.
* **CSS3:** Custom styling, Positions,Font-Style and responsive media queries.
* **JavaScript (ES6):** Interactive UI components.

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
├── index.html        # Main HTML structure
├── style.css         # Custom styles and layouts
├── script.js         # JavaScript interactivity
├── assets/           # Images and media assets
└── README.md         # Project documentation